                <pb facs="0497" n="483" sameAs="frus:frus1942v06/pg483"/>

                <head>Creation of Joint Mexican-United States Defense Commission</head>
                <p>[The Governments of Mexico and the United States announced on January 12, 1942,
                    the organization of a joint defense commission. The United States Section of the
                    Joint Mexican-United States Defense Commission was established by Executive
                    Order 9080 of February 27, 1942; for text, see 7 <hi rendition="#italic">Federal
                        Register</hi> 1607.]</p>
            </div>
